# bf-p4c build artifacts — regenerate with the documented bf-p4c 9.13.1 command
# recorded in each variant's NOTE.md.  Compile LOGS are deliberately NOT ignored:
# they are the evidence.  Only the binary/IR output trees are excluded.
#
# Covers `out/`, prefixed forms (`out_p6c/`) and suffixed forms (`probeB_out/`).
out/
out_*/
*_out/
**/out/
**/out_*/
**/*_out/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
